    "implementation_delta": "Make LogicProviderProtocol@2 canonical. Public LogicProviderProtocol aliases LogicProviderProtocolV2. Free-form v1 payloads cannot mint executable BackendRequest@2. The v1 adapter is explicit, fail-closed, and compatibility-only. Advisory v1 data is non-authoritative. Executable @2 operations require positive finite bounds. LogicPlatformManifest advertises LogicProviderProtocol@2 as the handshake protocol; v1 remains listed as compatibility-only. Live solvers remain typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
